      "matching.overall_score",
      "statistics.total_experience_years (edv_experience_since oder LLM-Schaetzung)",
      "statistics.demand_index (aus ES Skill-Frequenzen)",
      "skill_graph.nodes (LLM: weight aus Projekthaeufigkeit)",
      "SkillRelation Tabelle: edges ab frequency>=2 (belongs_to/related/domain)"
